     "id": "dawn",
     "c": {
      "type": "text",
      "md": "**Before six, the city is still.** Never more than {night.trips|integer} trips an hour: night shifts and early bakers."
     },
     "story": {
      "focus": "5 am"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "rush",
     "c": {
      "type": "text",
      "md": "**At {peak.label}, everyone leaves at once.** {peak.trips|integer} trips in one hour, most of them to the same few stations downtown."
     },
     "story": {
      "focus": "8 am"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "noon",
     "c": {
      "type": "text",
      "md": "**Midday is flat.** Lunch, errands, the odd meeting: steady, and about a third of the morning peak."
     },
     "story": {
      "focus": "12 pm"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "home",
     "c": {
      "type": "text",
      "md": "**The ride home spreads out.** It is as big as the ride in, but it lasts two hours instead of one."
     },
     "story": {
      "focus": "6 pm"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
